{"title": "Circlet of Fire", "pageid": 3625, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Circlet_of_Fire", "categories": ["Unobtainable", "Bugs", "Helmets", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r349439\">.mw-parser-output .ambox{margin:20px 10%;border-left:10px solid #969696;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image-div{width:40px}.mw-parser-output table.ambox+table.ambox,.mw-parser-output table.ambox+link+table.ambox,.mw-parser-output table.ambox+style+table.ambox{margin-top:-1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-empty-cell{border:none;padding:0;width:1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox th.mbox-text,.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-text{border:none;padding:0.25em 0.5em;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-image{padding:2px 0 2px 0.5em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-imageright{padding:2px 0.5em 2px 0;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-notice{border-left-color:#969696}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-speedy{background-color:#400805}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-speedy,.mw-parser-output table.ambox-delete{border-left-color:#b50000}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-content{border-left-color:#de5f16}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-style{border-left-color:#f0c146}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-protection{border-left-color:#4f4a39}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-move{border-left-color:#587cd1}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small{clear:right;float:right;margin:4px 0 4px 1em;box-sizing:border-box;width:238px;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small-left{margin:4px 1em 4px 0;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;width:238px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}</style><table class=\"ambox ambox-notice plainlinks metadata\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div style=\"width:52px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about an item or other previously obtainable content that has since been <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Unobtainable\" title=\"Category:Unobtainable\">removed from the game</a>, and is <b>no longer obtainable</b>, but <b>can</b> still be accessed via third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Icon.png/300px-Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/4/4e/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Circlet of Fire image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Icon.png/300px-Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Circlet of Fire</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Circlet</a> that grants the wearer a bonus action whenever they deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage with a leveled spell.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Merely holding the circlet makes your skin flush, filling you with determination and righteous fury.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" title=\"Helmets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/38px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/50px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helmets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 220 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  220  gp</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Fiery_Return\" title=\"Fiery Return\">Fiery Return</a></dt><dd>When you deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage with a levelled spell, you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burn</a> yourself and gain an additional <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> this round.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item is not present in the launch version of the game. Its effects have largely been replicated by the <a href=\"/wiki/Pyroquickness_Hat\" title=\"Pyroquickness Hat\">Pyroquickness Hat</a> found in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.</li>\n<li>In Early Access versions of the game the circlet could be found in a gilded chest in the final room of the <a href=\"/wiki/Apothecary%27s_Cellar\" title=\"Apothecary's Cellar\">Apothecary's Cellar</a> beneath the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-659&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-370</span>. The cellar can be accessed through the building directly behind the village's <a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Rune_Circle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ancient Rune Circle\">Ancient Rune Circle</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Fiery Return:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The conditions for activating Fiery Return are to deal fire damage with a non-cantrip spell <em>or</em> a melee spell attack roll.\n<ul><li>Attacks with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flame Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a> conjured by the druid spell count as melee spell attacks, so they trigger Fiery Return. However, this is not true of a Flame Blade summoned by a <a href=\"/wiki/Mephistopheles_tiefling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mephistopheles tiefling\">mephistopheles tiefling's</a> racial feature or a permanent Flame Blade acquired through the exploit described <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade#Bugs\" title=\"Flame Blade\">here</a>.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daredevil_Gloves\" title=\"Daredevil Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daredevil_Gloves\" title=\"Daredevil Gloves\">Daredevil Gloves</a> can turn ranged spell attacks into melee spell attacks, so cantrips like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Bolt\" title=\"Fire Bolt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/30px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/40px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Bolt\" title=\"Fire Bolt\">Fire Bolt</a> <em>can</em> trigger Fiery Return when paired with the gloves.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Fiery Return:</i></p>\n<ul><li>If Fiery Return is triggered with a <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> (for example, with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Quickened_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/20px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/30px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/40px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/20px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Quickened_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\">Metamagic: Quickened Spell</a>), the extra bonus action granted by this passive is wasted and consumed immediately.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellcrawler\" title=\"Hellcrawler\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Hellcrawler_Icon.webp/20px-Hellcrawler_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Hellcrawler_Icon.webp/30px-Hellcrawler_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Hellcrawler_Icon.webp/40px-Hellcrawler_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellcrawler\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Hellcrawler_Icon.webp/20px-Hellcrawler_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Hellcrawler_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellcrawler\" title=\"Hellcrawler\">Hellcrawler</a>, a class action granted by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Boots\" title=\"Helldusk Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Boots\" title=\"Helldusk Boots\">Helldusk Boots</a>, triggers Fiery Return, essentially negating the bonus action cost.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite\" title=\"Searing Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Searing Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite\" title=\"Searing Smite\">Searing Smite</a> does not trigger Fiery Return.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200657\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.084 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1662/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48297/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13059/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.025/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1208716/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   68.741      1 -total\n 66.20%   45.505      1 Template:Eq